{"at": "2026-11-06T08:03:01.622933+00:00", "event_id": "01M6QY3VBQWW6H16JZCR2P4XBR", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M6QY3S1H6G5N853PJAPJS7CE", "final_answer": "The resolved status surface is the only source of truth; a lane worktree's own status files never count (#6466, #6884).", "mission_id": "01M6QY1MKKW6AA3EBKSJ0VVAMP", "mission_slug": "lane-worktree-model-hardening-01M6QY1M", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": true, "rationale": "Operator ruling, stijn-dejongh, 2026-11-06 (epic #7276). Quoted as given.", "recorded_at": "2026-11-06T08:03:01.622933Z", "resolved_by": "stijn-dejongh", "run_id": "01M6QY3S1H6G5N853PJAPJS7CE", "state_entered_at": "2026-11-06T08:03:01.621527Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
{"at": "2026-11-06T08:03:04.051820+00:00", "event_id": "01M6QY3XQKKX5VF8BNZDNT5NGA", "event_type": "DecisionPointOpened", "payload": {"actor_id": "claude", "actor_type": "human", "decision_point_id": "01M6QY3XQJ5NAYVF3GMZ7ZPPRE", "input_key": "ruling3_implementation", "mission_id": "01M6QY1MKKW6AA3EBKSJ0VVAMP", "mission_slug": "lane-worktree-model-hardening-01M6QY1M", "mission_type": "software-dev", "options": [], "origin_flow": "specify", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "phase": "SPECIFY", "question": "Escalation: physically deleting status files from lane branches would be carried onto the coordination/Mission branch by consolidation, trips auto-rebase and conflicts with ADR 2026-07-29-1 Assert A'. How is ruling 3 implemented?", "recorded_at": "2026-11-06T08:03:04.051820Z", "run_id": "01M6QY3XQJ5NAYVF3GMZ7ZPPRE", "state_entered_at": "2026-11-06T08:03:04.050172Z", "step_id": "specify.escalation.ruling3-restated"}}
{"at": "2026-11-06T08:03:06.401320+00:00", "event_id": "01M6QY40115BAXKXQXJVV4EV33", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M6QY3XQJ5NAYVF3GMZ7ZPPRE", "final_answer": "Restate it: lane checkouts never show the status files (sparse exclusion at every lane-checkout creation site, lanes topology included), lanes never change them (a write-check refuses), readers never read them (S1). A migration applies the exclusion to existing lane worktrees and reports, never drops, lane-only events. The fork-time blob stays in lane history.", "mission_id": "01M6QY1MKKW6AA3EBKSJ0VVAMP", "mission_slug": "lane-worktree-model-hardening-01M6QY1M", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": true, "rationale": "Operator ruling, stijn-dejongh, 2026-11-06 (epic #7276). Quoted as given.", "recorded_at": "2026-11-06T08:03:06.401320Z", "resolved_by": "stijn-dejongh", "run_id": "01M6QY3XQJ5NAYVF3GMZ7ZPPRE", "state_entered_at": "2026-11-06T08:03:06.399714Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
